centage} rgbChannel {RGB channel} hue {Hue} hslPercentage {HSL percentage} saturation {Saturation} lightness {Lightness} other {Color channel}} must be a finite number.","color.channelRange":"{channel, select, alpha {Alpha} rgbPercentage {RGB percentage} rgbChannel {RGB channel} hue {Hue} hslPercentage {HSL percentage} saturation {Saturation} lightness {Lightness} other {Color channel}} must be {min}–{max}.","color.syntax":"Enter HEX, rgb(), hsl(), or a CSS color name.","color.standaloneRecovery":"Use a standalone color; variables and relative colors need stylesheet context.","workspace.generateVariation":"Generate variation","workspace.yourPalette":"Your palette","workspace.buildAPalette":"Build a palette","workspace.paletteSwatches":"Palette swatches","workspace.selectAColorToEditClickHex":"Select a color to edit · Click HEX to copy · Lock colors to keep them","workspace.paletteColors":"Palette colors","workspace.clickToEditDragToReorderOr":"Click to edit. Drag to reorder, or use the handle below.","workspace.dragToReorderOrPressSpaceArrow":"Drag to reorder, or press Space, arrow keys, then Space.","workspace.checkContrast":"Check contrast ↗","workspace.exportPalette":"Export palette","workspace.startingColor":"Starting color","workspace.harmony":"Harmony","workspace.colors2":"Colors","workspace.exportFormat":"Export format","workspace.cssVariables":"CSS variables","workspace.json":"JSON","workspace.svgSwatches":"SVG swatches","workspace.checkColors":"Check your colors.","errors.palette":"Use 2–10 valid colors with unique IDs. Reset to generate a new palette.","errors.count":"Choose 2–10 colors.","errors.locked-color":"Unlock later colors before reducing the palette size.","errors.harmony":"Choose a supported color harmony.","errors.variation":"Variation must be a non-negative integer.","workspace.paletteCount":"{count, plural, one {# color} other {# colors}} · {locked, number} locked","workspace.editColor":"Edit {color}","workspace.copyColor":"Copy {color}","work