n endless loop or work that can be made smaller, then run again.","codeRun.outputLimit":"Your program printed more than the allowed amount of {stream, select, stderr {error output} other {output}}.","codeRun.outputLimitDetail":"The output below is cut off. Print less, then run again.","codeRun.unavailable":"Code execution is not available right now.","codeRun.unavailableDetail":"{reason, select, notConfigured {Running code is switched off on this server.} runtimeMissing {This language version is not installed on the execution server.} other {The execution server did not respond.}} Your code is kept. Try again in a minute.","codeRun.busy":"The execution server is busy.","codeRun.busyDetail":"Your code is kept. Try again in {seconds} seconds.","codeRun.fact.time":"Run time","codeRun.fact.cpu":"CPU time","codeRun.fact.memory":"Memory","codeRun.fact.exit":"Exit code","codeRun.fact.signal":"Signal","codeRun.fact.language":"Language","codeRun.section.stdout":"Standard output","codeRun.section.stderr":"Error output","codeRun.section.compiler":"Compiler output","codeRunner.editor":"{language} source code","codeRunner.stdin":"Standard input (stdin)","codeRunner.stdinHelp":"Type anything your program reads before you press Run. Input cannot be typed while the program is running.","codeRunner.stdinPlaceholder":"Optional. For example: Ada","codeRunner.run":"Run","codeRunner.cancel":"Cancel","codeRunner.runTooltip":"Run your program ({shortcut})","codeRunner.cancelTooltip":"Stop this run. Your code stays as it is.","codeRunner.running":"Running your program…","codeRunner.cancelled":"Run cancelled. Your code is unchanged.","codeRunner.reset":"Reset to starter","codeRunner.resetTitle":"Reset to the starter program?","codeRunner.resetBody":"Your current code is replaced by the starter program and your saved draft is removed.","codeRunner.resetConfirm":"Reset","codeRunner.resetKeep":"Keep my code","codeRunner.upload":"Upload file","codeRunner.uploadFailed":"{name} could not be read as text.","codeRunner.uploadTooLarge":"{name} is larger than {max} KiB. Choose a smaller file.","codeRunner.download":"Download source","codeRunner.version":"{language} version","codeRunner.versionTooltip":"Choose which version runs your code. Each run uses exactly that version.","codeRunner.draftNote":"Your code is saved in this browser only, until you run it.","codeRunner.resultPlaceholder":"Press Run to see what your program prints, or why it stopped."},"toolId":"devtools.ruby-compiler","slug":"ruby-compiler","app":"devtools","category":"compilers","keywords":["ruby","ruby compiler","online ruby","run ruby","ruby interpreter","ruby playground"],"name":"Ruby Compiler","description":"Write and run Ruby 4 code in your browser. Add input, press Run, and read the output or the exact error. Nothing to install.","input":{"kind":"text","label":"Ruby code","showLineNumbers":true,"maxLength":65536,"acceptFiles":{"accept":".rb,text/plain","maxBytes":65536},"secondary":{"label":"Standard input (stdin)","placeholder":"Optional. For example: Ada"}},"settings":{"fields":{"version":{"kind":"select","label":"Version","help":"Each run uses exactly this version.","default":"4.0","choices":[{"value":"4.0","label":"Ruby 4.0"},{"value":"3.4","label":"Ruby 3.4"}]}}},"resultStats":"status-only","trigger":{"mode":"manual","actionLabel":"Run"},"capabilities":{"cancel":true,"copy":true,"download":true,"network":true},"workbenchMark":{"text":"RB","tone":"contrast"},"labels":{"result":"Result","empty":"Press Run to see what your program prints, or why it stopped.","ready":"Your program finished. The result explains what happened.","running":"Running your program…"},"content":{"seoTitle":"Online Ruby Compiler — Run Ruby 4 Code","howToUse":["The editor starts with a small Ruby program that reads a name from standard input and greets it, so you can press Run straight away.","Write or paste your Ruby code. Anything your program reads from the keyboard goes in the Standard input box before you run it.","Press Run or Ctrl/Cmd+Enter. The result starts with one sentence saying what happened, followed by the output, error output and exit code.","If something goes wrong the message names the cause. Fix your code and run again. Your code is kept in this browser while you work."],"limitations":["You can run Ruby 4.0, Ruby 3.4. Pick one in the version menu above the editor; each run uses that exact release.","Each run is stopped after 5 seconds of running time (3 seconds of CPU time), and is limited to 256 MiB of memory and 64 KiB of output.","Source code and input are each limited to 64 KiB. Command-line arguments are not supported.","There is no network access, no way to install packages and no files that last between runs.","Input cannot be typed while the program runs. Put everything it will read in the Standard input box first.","If many people run code at once, the server may ask you to wait a few seconds. Your code is kept when that happens."],"faq":[{"q":"Is my code sent to a server, and is it saved?","a":"Yes, your code and input are sent to Canopy's execution server so it can run the program. It runs once in an isolated sandbox and is not stored. A draft stays in your own browser so a refresh does not lose your work."},{"q":"Which Ruby versions can I use?","a":"Ruby 4.0, Ruby 3.4. Ruby 4.0 is selected first; change it in the version menu above the editor. Each choice is an exact release (4.0.9, 3.4.12), so results stay the same until the page is updated."},{"q":"Can I install gems?","a":"No. Only the Ruby standard library is available, because the sandbox has no network access and gems cannot be installed."},{"q":"Why was my program stopped?","a":"Programs that run longer than the time limit, use too much memory or print too much are stopped to keep the service fair. The result tells you which limit was reached."}],"examples":[{"label":"Hello with input","text":"name = ($stdin.gets || \"\").strip\nname = \"world\" if name.empty?\nputs \"Hello, #{name}!\"\n","secondary":"Ada"}],"relatedToolIds":["devtools.kotlin-compiler","devtools.bash-compiler","devtools.python-compiler"]}}$spec$::json, updated_at = now()
  WHERE tool_id = 'devtools.ruby-compiler' AND spec IS NULL;
